# Mobile (Capacitor Android wrapper, see capacitor.config.json)
node_modules/
# Build-generated copy of the actual web app source (index.html/js/css/
# assets/core/lib/celestial-data) - package.json's own "prepare-www"
# script regenerates this before every `cap sync`, never hand-edited.
www/
# android/ itself IS committed (the native project, same convention any
# Capacitor/React Native project follows) - its own build artifacts are
# already covered by android/.gitignore (generated by `cap add android`).
